add('gallium-oxygen-reported','Liquid gallium oxidation equation',[(Ga,4),(O,3)],[(gaoxide,2)],['none'],'The primary study reports the liquid-Ga oxidation relation and native oxide formation; full oxidation kinetics are not modeled. Equation only.',[gaprimary],['solid'],['The reported oxidation equation has Ga₂O₃ as a solid endpoint.'],'This exact liquid-gallium/oxygen relation appears in the study’s thermodynamic discussion with observed surface oxidation. It is retained as an equation, not a claim of unrestricted bulk conversion or direct nitride synthesis.',True)
